  "brief": {
    "idea": "Organic, tutorial-style: loading Autechre's public Quaristice-tour SysEx (the Machinedrum backup of 1 March 2008, released free on their store in 2018) into the Machinedrum Editor and playing it. The Monomachine file follows as a second post. Credit on screen and in the caption, with a link to their store. Nothing may say or suggest that Autechre, Warp or Elektron endorse, use or know of the editors.",
